{{root|en|ine-pro|*(s)ker- (turn)}}
{{inh+|en|enm|curtine}}, from {{der|en|fro|cortine}}, from {{der|en|LL.|cōrtīna|t=curtain|id=curtain}}, a calque from {{der|en|grc|-}}.

